                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular'>Information about this chart:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>The table displays the </run>
                <run fontcolor='#4629ff' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>LOW PERFORMER</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'> employee&apos;s details which includes the classification it belongs to.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular'>User Access Restrictions:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>This table is </run>
                <run fontcolor='#ed2e2e' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>RESTRICTED</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'> to relevant users as it contains employee-level information. For access, please request approval from your direct manager.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular'>Note:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>The employee list is a combination of EOY and MOY Low Performers. In order to track an employee&apos;s rating, please select which </run>
                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>Low Performer Type</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'> you would like to analyze using the available filter in the menu.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular'>How to read the ratings:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#040c28' fontname='Google Sans' fontsize='9'>• </run>
                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>Current Rating</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>Æ </run>
                <run fontcolor='#ed2e2e' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'>→ </run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>Data point to identify the baseline rating of an employee according to the </run>
                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>Low Performer Type.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#040c28' fontname='Google Sans' fontsize='9'>• </run>
                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>Subsequent Rating</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>Æ </run>
                <run fontcolor='#ed2e2e' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'>→ </run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>Data point to identify the following rating of an employee according to the </run>
                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>Low Performer Type.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#040c28' fontname='Google Sans' fontsize='9'>• </run>
                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>Second Subsequent Rating</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>Æ </run>
                <run fontcolor='#ed2e2e' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'>→ </run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'> Data point to identify the second following rating of an employee according to the </run>
