                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>The KPI Scorecards displays the breakdown of employees rated as </run>
                <run fontcolor='#4629ff' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>LOW PERFORMERS</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'> in the selected </run>
                <run fontcolor='#4629ff' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>END OF YEAR REVIEW CYCLE. </run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>It highlights the proportion of employees </run>
