                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular'>Interactivity:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>Hover over a scorecard to see more information.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular'>Note:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>1) EOY Low Performers </run>
                <run fontcolor='#ed2e2e' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'>→</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>Received an EOY Rating</run>
                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>Æ </run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>of </run>
                <run fontcolor='#4629ff' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>Development Needed</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'> or</run>
                <run fontcolor='#666666' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>Æ </run>
                <run fontcolor='#4629ff' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>Unsatisfactory.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>2) MOY NEW Low Performers </run>
                <run fontcolor='#ed2e2e' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='8'>→</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>Received an EOY Rating of </run>
                <run fontcolor='#4629ff' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>Outstanding</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>, </run>
                <run fontcolor='#4629ff' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>Exceeding</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>, or</run>
                <run fontcolor='#666666' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>Æ </run>
                <run fontcolor='#4629ff' fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'>Performing</run>
                <run fontname='Tableau Regular' fontsize='9'> but had a </run>
